---
// input: Reported evolution timing, 42x speed, fruit chain, reset losses, and comparison rules
// output: Sell Lemons evolution guide page for reset risk, timing, and progression decisions
// pos: /Users/tangjei/Documents/建站/游戏站/selllemonswiki/src/pages/evolution.astro (更新规则：文件变更需同步本注释与所属目录 README)
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import RelatedGuides from "../components/RelatedGuides.astro";
import VideoGuideBlock from "../components/VideoGuideBlock.astro";

const fruitChain = [
  "Fruit chain progress is reported as part of the evolution path.",
  "Void Portal and late fruit steps should be treated as pending until checked in-game.",
  "Do not evolve only because a guide says the next fruit exists; confirm your rebuild speed first."
];

const resetLosses = [
  { label: "Investors", status: "reported", value: "Evolution is reported to reset or consume investor progress." },
  { label: "Powers", status: "reported", value: "Community pages report power loss or reset pressure after evolving." },
  { label: "Requirement number", status: "reported", value: "501.2 Quadrillion Investors is reported, but some pages still mark requirements as TBA." },
  { label: "Speed reward", status: "reported", value: "42x Global Speed is reported, not verified by this site." }
];

const comparisonRows = [
  { layer: "Rebirth", use: "Earlier investor scaling and first reset loops." },
  { layer: "Evolution", use: "Major speed reset with reported 42x route value and investor/power cost." },
  { layer: "Ascend", use: "Intermediate term used by some guides; confirm context before following." },
  { layer: "Ascension", use: "Endgame reset with Forever Purchase planning and higher rebuild cost." }
];

const youtubeEmbeds = [
  {
    title: "How To EVOLVE in Sell Lemons",
    embedUrl: "https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/LsghH1imBJk",
    sourceUrl: "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LsghH1imBJk",
    status: "youtube_embed",
    note: "Use as a visual evolution walkthrough. The exact threshold is still reported, not verified."
  },
  {
    title: "How To Unlock Portal In Sell Lemons Roblox",
    embedUrl: "https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/PvfhwEKSisg",
    sourceUrl: "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PvfhwEKSisg",
    status: "youtube_embed",
    note: "Helps players orient around portal steps, but does not verify portal requirements."
  },
  {
    title: "HOW To EVOLVE in Sell Lemons",
    embedUrl: "https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/LZOPoqoQWjE",
    sourceUrl: "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LZOPoqoQWjE",
    status: "youtube_embed",
    note: "Supplemental visual reference for evolution timing and menu flow."
  }
];
---

<SiteLayout title="Sell Lemons Evolution Guide: 42x Speed and Reset Timing" description="Use a Sell Lemons evolution guide for 42x speed, fruit chain planning, investor reset risk, when not to evolve, and reset layer comparisons.">
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero guide-detail-hero">
      <div class="wrap page-hero__grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Reset Planning</p>
          <h1>Sell Lemons Evolution Guide</h1>
          <p>Evolution can bring a reported 42x speed layer, but it can also reset investors and powers. Treat it as a rebuild decision, not a free upgrade button.</p>
        </div>
        <img src="/sell_lemons_hero_main.png" alt="Sell Lemons evolution guide with speed route planning" width="894" height="500" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <article class="guide-detail">
      <p class="evidence-note">Reported mechanic: players describe evolution as a major speed layer. Treat exact multiplier and requirement numbers as pending unless checked in-game.</p>

      <h2>Evolution Decision Flow</h2>
      <div class="info-grid">
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <span class="tag">reported</span>
          <h3>1. Confirm rebuild speed</h3>
          <p>Reset only when your early income and key unlock path can rebuild quickly. If the first stages still feel slow, upgrade income sources and automation first.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <span class="tag">reported</span>
          <h3>2. Check investor scaling</h3>
          <p>Investor progress matters because it supports later reset layers. Compare your current route against the rebirth guide before pressing a reset button.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <span class="tag">pending</span>
          <h3>3. Watch the Void route</h3>
          <p>Void-related upgrades and event timing can change which purchase is best. Use the profit calculator when comparing a slow source against a global multiplier.</p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <h2>Fruit Chain</h2>
      <ol class="mobile-step-list">
        {fruitChain.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
      </ol>

      <h2>What Resets</h2>
      <div class="route-table">
        {resetLosses.map((item) => (
          <div>
            <strong>{item.label} <span class="tag">{item.status}</span></strong>
            <span>{item.value}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <h2>When Not to Evolve</h2>
      <div class="info-grid">
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <span class="tag">pending</span>
          <h3>Investor bonus is too low</h3>
          <p>The 200% investor bonus threshold is a community suggestion, not verified rule text.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <span class="tag">reported</span>
          <h3>Managers are not rebuilt quickly</h3>
          <p>If automation takes too long after reset, the 42x speed claim may not help immediately.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <span class="tag">reported</span>
          <h3>You are close to Ascension checks</h3>
          <p>Compare evolution timing against Ascension requirements before burning a strong current route.</p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <h2>Reset Layer Comparison</h2>
      <div class="route-table">
        {comparisonRows.map((item) => (
          <div>
            <strong>{item.layer}</strong>
            <span>{item.use}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <VideoGuideBlock
        id="evolution-video-guides"
        title="Video Evolution References"
        note="youtube_embed: these videos are visual route examples only. They do not verify the 42x value, investor threshold, or fruit chain requirements."
        videos={youtubeEmbeds}
      />

      <h2>Internal Planning Links</h2>
      <div class="mini-table">
        <a href="/profit-calculator/">Calculate upgrade ROI</a>
        <a href="/rebirths/">Review rebirth timing</a>
        <a href="/ascension/">Prepare ascension</a>
        <a href="/money-fast/">Improve cash route speed</a>
      </div>

      <RelatedGuides currentSlug="evolution" />
    </article>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
